# Production build config, read automatically by `vite build`.
#
# On Render these are injected at build time by render.yaml (via the backend
# service's `host` property) — do NOT set them here, or the empty values would
# shadow the injected ones and break the API/WebSocket URLs.
#
# For a manual/local production build you can export them in your shell:
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://<backend-host>/api  VITE_WS_URL=wss://<backend-host>/ws  npm run build
